BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:OCAD U Gala
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T235900
UID:ocad-u-gala@ocadu.ca
DESCRIPTION:Convening Toronto's most creative and influential minds in the
  art and design sector\, the OCAD U Gala returns this spring!\n\nGET READY
  TO EXPERIENCE TORONTO’S FAST-GROWING ART AND DESIGN EVENT Celebrating t
 he talent and creativity of artists and designers in support of students a
 t OCAD University.\n\nFollowing a standout debut last spring\, the OCAD U 
 Gala returns on May 27\, 2026 \, as a rising highlight in Toronto’s cult
 ural calendar. This annual event brings together the city’s most creativ
 e thinkers for an immersive evening that showcases visionary ideas\, excep
 tional talent and the vibrant spirit of our University. With the support o
 f our generous sponsors\, guests will experience striking art activations\
 , bold design moments and an atmosphere alive with energy—reflecting the
  gala’s growing momentum as one of Toronto’s premier art and design ce
 lebrations.\n\nThe Event at a Glance May 27 at 6:30 p.m. VIP Reception Art
  Installations and Experiences Dinner and Program Live Art Auction After P
 arty For one night only\, guests will also have the opportunity to bid on 
 one-of-a-kind artwork by leading and emerging artists and designers. Previ
 ous auctions at the OCAD U Gala have featured works by globally recognized
  artists such as Steve Driscoll\, Pixie Shaw and Alexander McLeod. Don’t
  miss your chance to be part of this exclusive event in the heart of Toron
 to’s vibrant art and design scene.\n\nAdvancing Student Success Funds ra
 ised at the gala will establish vital student bursaries at OCAD U that red
 uce financial barriers to a leading art and design university education. T
 his crucial support fosters the growth and talent of future creative leade
 rs and innovators.\n\nBuy tickets\n\nTable Reservations & Sponsorship Oppo
 rtunities\n\nConnect your brand with our exclusive guest list that include
 s Toronto’s most influential philanthropists\, art and design patrons an
 d creative leaders. To reserve your table or explore sponsorship opportuni
 ties\, contact Mary Koutsoubos\, Executive Director\, Advancement\, at mar
 yk@ocadu.ca or 416-977-6000\, Ext. 480.\n\nThe celebration continues at th
 e OCAD U Gala After Party! Experience the energy of the OCAD U community a
 longside Toronto’s most creative and influential minds in a vibrant\, im
 mersive atmosphere filled with music\, art\, signature cocktails and gourm
 et desserts. Tickets are available for purchase now. Spots are limited—g
 et yours before they’re gone! Dress Code: Creative Cocktail *Note: If yo
 u’ve already purchased a ticket or are attending the OCAD U Gala\, your 
 entry to the After Party is free.\n\nBuy After Party Tickets\n\nThe OCAD U
  Gala Committee\n\nWe are grateful to our dedicated Gala Committee members
 \, whose vision and leadership are helping bring this extraordinary event 
 to life.\n\nAmy Burstyn-Fritz\, Co-Founder of Misette - Co-Chair\n\nJeff H
 ull\, President\, Hullmark - Co-Chair\n\nColleen Baldwin Chris Braden Jacl
 yn Cobourn Alison Currie Rana Florida Alan Gertner Nandini Gupta Alison Mi
 lne Jordin Mimran Tanya Taylor\n\nHighlights from the Inaugural OCAD U Gal
 a\n\nTHANK YOU TO OUR OCAD U GALA SPONSORS
LOCATION:Main Building & Rosalie Sharp Centre for Design (MCA) 100 McCaul 
 Street
URL:https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsecu
 re3.convio.net%2Focadu%2Fsite%2FTicketing%3Fview%3DTickets%26id%3D102173&d
 ata=05%7C02%7Cwebsupport%40ocadu.ca%7C465295de16a74bff2eff08de845602e2%7C0
 6e469d12d2a468fae9b7df0968eb6d7%7C0%7C0%7C639093702745936498%7CUnknown%7CT
 WFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkF
 OIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=lWAztG2H92Ve3uK4oLKZcN%2B
 VyIfZfwlZSqCVPycCY%2Fw%3D&reserved=0
